OL,3,ASurprisingly strong US jobs figures
OL,4,Afuel rate rise bets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boost in hospitality and education
OL,7,Femployment drove the US economy to
OL,8,Fcreate tens of thousands more jobs than
OL,9,Fexpected last month, latest figures
OL,10,Fsuggest.
OL,12,FThe number of roles added to the
OL,13,Fworld's biggest economy increased by
OL,14,F162,000 in August, almost triple the
OL,15,F56,000 forecast by analysts.
OL,17,FThe stronger jobs figures are likely to
OL,18,Fadd to growing expectations that the
OL,19,FFederal Reserve will increase interest
OL,20,Frates later this month.
